Description: Samba JSON Audit Event Handler for Edulution
 A Python daemon that reads Samba JSON Audit events from the systemd
 journal and triggers configurable hooks (scripts/webhooks) when
 specific events occur.
 .
 Features:
  - Reads Samba audit events directly from systemd journal
  - Automatic push of all events to Edulution server
  - LDAP/AD integration for user group membership lookup
  - Configurable match conditions with dot notation for nested fields
  - Supports async script execution and webhooks
  - Automatic config reload on file changes
  - Automatic Samba JSON audit logging configuration
  - Included hook script for Sophos XGS firewall integration

